<title>JAPAN: Aucnet - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Aucnet - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.63		vs	    2.95</p>
<p> Operating	    1.12		vs	  943    million</p>
<p> Current		1.14		vs	  984    million</p>
<p> Net	    568    million	  vs	  513    million</p>
<p> EPS		   59.94 yen	  vs	   59.58 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Aucnet Inc auctions used cars. Its net was up 10.7 pct.</p>
